---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects - Armaan Agrawal" description="Explore the startups and projects Armaan Agrawal is building.">
  <main class="min-h-screen py-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">Projects</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 max-w-3xl">
          I believe the best way to learn is by building. Here are some of the things I'm working on or have built.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Projects Grid -->
      <div class="space-y-24">
        <!-- Project 1 -->
        <article class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
          <div>
            <img 
              src="/images/image.jpg" 
              alt="Current startup project"
              class="w-full h-auto"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Current Venture</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              Building tools for founders to make faster, better decisions. We're solving the information 
              overload problem that kills early-stage startups.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              The first version focuses on helping solo founders and small teams organize their thinking 
              without adding overhead. Launch date TBA.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4">
              <span class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 mr-2">In Progress</span>
              <span class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2">SaaS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Project 2 -->
        <article class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
          <div class="md:order-2">
            <img 
              src="/images/image.jpg" 
              alt="Productivity research project"
              class="w-full h-auto"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 md:order-1">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Productivity Research</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              A year-long experiment testing different productivity systems on real teams. 
              We tracked what actually improved output versus what just felt productive.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              The results challenged most conventional wisdom about time management and team collaboration. 
              I'm compiling the findings into a series of essays.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4">
              <span class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 mr-2">Research</span>
              <span class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2">2024</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Project 3 -->
        <article class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
          <div>
            <img 
              src="/images/image.jpg" 
              alt="Past venture"
              class="w-full h-auto"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Previous Ventures</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              I've started and shut down three companies. Each one taught me something different about 
              building products, finding customers, and knowing when to quit.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              The failures were more valuable than any success could have been. I write about these 
              lessons regularly on the blog.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4">
              <span class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 mr-2">Completed</span>
              <span class="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2">2020-2023</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Call to Action -->
      <div class="mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Working on something similar?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          I'm always interested in talking to other founders. Reach out on X or LinkedIn.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="https://x.com/airman416" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
             class="bg-black text-white px-6 py-3">
            Message on X
          </a>
          <a href="/blog" class="border-2 border-black text-black px-6 py-3">
            Read the Blog
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
